# Scoped to this project only -- sibling projects in the monorepo are unaffected.

# The zip built by tools/Build-Distro.ps1 IS published, from this folder, so it
# is deliberately not ignored here.
#
# It must never sit in distro/, for two reasons:
#
#   1. Build-Distro.ps1 verifies the package against a strict allowlist of the
#      four files that ship. Anything else there is reported as "unexpected
#      file" and the build exits non-zero -- for every fresh clone, not just on
#      the machine that put it there.
#   2. distro/ is the input the zip is built FROM, so a zip parked there is
#      packed into the next one, nesting a copy of itself and adding a megabyte
#      each time.
#
# This rule cannot live in a distro/.gitignore: that file would itself trip the
# allowlist in reason 1 and then ship inside the package. Hence the scoped path.
distro/*.zip

summary.md
